    <description>Policy 에서 참여 보험사/분납정보 입력 후 실행되는 Policy Line Item(Status : New) 생성 플로우</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_Accounting_Currency</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASE(
TEXT( {!Get_Insurance_Policy.BizRegion__c}),
&quot;LK_KR&quot;, &quot;KRW&quot;,
&quot;LK_Re&quot;, &quot;USD&quot;,
&quot;LK_VN&quot;, &quot;VND&quot;,
&quot;LK_A&amp;G&quot;, &quot;KRW&quot;,
&quot;&quot;
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>보험사별 수수료 /  보험사별 보험료</description>
        <name>fm_BrokerageRate</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>ROUND(( {!fm_ParticipantBrokerage} / {!fm_ParticipantPremium} ) * 100,2)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_GroupInsurance</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>{!Loop_Insurance_Policy_Participant.EGIGroupInsurance_is__c}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>분납회차별 보험사별 수수료</description>
        <name>fm_ParticipantBrokerage</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Loop_Premium_Schedule.CRSInstallBrokerage__c}</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>분납회차별 보험사별 보험료</description>
        <name>fm_ParticipantPremium</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Loop_Premium_Schedule.CRSInstallPremium__c}</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>LK보험번호_Insurer_분납회차</description>
        <name>fm_RecordName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Insurance_Policy.LKRefNoh__c} &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; {!Loop_Insurance_Policy_Participant.Insurer__r.Name} &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; TEXT ( {!var_InstallNo} )</expression>
    </formulas>
